{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Come, let us deal wisely</b> — הבה equals 12, i.e., they schemed against the 12 tribes." "<b>And it shall come to pass when a war befalls</b> — for he feared lest the kings of Canaan come against him in war over the silver he had gathered from them." "<b>And he will add</b> — three times in the Masorah: here, and the other: ונוסף על נחלת המטה. There is one who scatters, and he adds yet more. For Egypt said: they will drive us from the land, and he will add to his inheritance — that he will take all the land. And the Holy One, blessed be He, says: there is one who scatters — you want to scatter them and diminish them, yet he adds yet more, that he multiplies them a thousandfold."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:37.793155481Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}